BD-p5_7-6\">7.6</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"M. Sean Molley (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTS5fU2Vhbl9Nb2xsZXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">M. Sean Molley</span>&#160;(August 2010). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Tyranny%27s_Bleak_Depths\" title=\"Tyranny's Bleak Depths\">Tyranny's Bleak Depths</a></i> (SPEC2-2 P1). <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Forgotten_Realms\" title=\"Living Forgotten Realms\">Living Forgotten Realms</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/RPGA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"RPGA\">RPGA</a>), p. 5.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-TBD-p23-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBD-p23_8-0\">8.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBD-p23_8-1\">8.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBD-p23_8-2\">8.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBD-p23_8-3\">8.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"M. Sean Molley (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTS5fU2Vhbl9Nb2xsZXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">M. Sean Molley</span>&#160;(August 2010). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Tyranny%27s_Bleak_Depths\" title=\"Tyranny's Bleak Depths\">Tyranny's Bleak Depths</a></i> (SPEC2-2 P1). <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Forgotten_Realms\" title=\"Living Forgotten Realms\">Living Forgotten Realms</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/RPGA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"RPGA\">RPGA</a>), p. 23.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-TBD-p31-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBD-p31_9-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"M. Sean Molley (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTS5fU2Vhbl9Nb2xsZXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">M. Sean Molley</span>&#160;(August 2010). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Tyranny%27s_Bleak_Depths\" title=\"Tyranny's Bleak Depths\">Tyranny's Bleak Depths</a></i> (SPEC2-2 P1). <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Forgotten_Realms\" title=\"Living Forgotten Realms\">Living Forgotten Realms</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/RPGA\" class=\"mw